.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH KOBAS 1 2000-1月 "kobas.term_cluster" "kobas.term_cluster"
.SH NAME
kobas.term_cluster \- Cluster the given terms by the pairwise similarity.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIkobas.term_cluster(\fBterms\fR as list, 
\fBthreshold\fR as double = 0.35, 
\fBmethod\fR as string = "kappa", 
\fBuniverse\fR as integer = -1, 
\fBpvalue\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cluster the given terms by the pairwise similarity.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBterms\fB \fR\- 
 a named \fBlist\fR of the character vectors, see the \fBterms\fR parameter of
 \fBkobas.term_similarity\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBthreshold\fB \fR\- the similarity threshold of the term cluster, default \fB0.35\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmethod\fB \fR\- the similarity method: \fBkappa\fR (default) or \fBjaccard\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBuniverse\fB \fR\- the gene universe size of the kappa method, default \fB-1\fR (auto).. 
.PP
.PP
\fBpvalue\fB \fR\- 
 an optional numeric vector of the p-values of the terms, it is used for scoring the
 term cluster (the geometric mean of \fB-log10(p)\fR). Default \fBNULL\fR means \fBNA\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a \fBdataframe\fR with the cluster index as the row names and the columns:
 \fBsize\fR (the number of the terms in the cluster), \fBscore\fR, \fBmembers\fR (the term
 ids joined by \fB;\fR) and \fBindex\fR (the term index in the input term list).
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
The cluster self test of the KOBAS algorithm requires more than 3 pairwise
 similarities, that means a cluster should contain at least 4 terms.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
KOBAS
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
